{"words": [{"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "بِأَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "(is) because they"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "say"}, {"text": "لَن", "translation": "Never"}, {"text": "تَمَسَّنَا", "translation": "will touch us"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارُ", "translation": "the Fire"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَيَّامًۭا", "translation": "(for) days"}, {"text": "مَّعْدُودَٰتٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "numbered"}, {"text": "وَغَرَّهُمْ", "translation": "And deceived them"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "دِينِهِم", "translation": "their religion"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they were"}, {"text": "يَفْتَرُونَ", "translation": "inventing"}], "sahih": "That is because they say, \"Never will the Fire touch us except for [a few] numbered days,\" and [because] they were deluded in their religion by what they were inventing."}